<h1>Chatting App</h1>

<p>Click on the Chat Client nav link to start!</p>

<nav>How to use:</nav>
<li><strong>Step 1:</strong> Enter your desirable user name in the ID box.</li>
<li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Click 'Connect' button to connect with other user.</li>
<li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Enter your message in the chat box and press 'Enter' key to send the message.</li>
<li><strong>Step 4:</strong> Enjoy chatting!</li>
<li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Once done with the chatting, close the window or click 'Disconnect' button.</li>